<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,073 in March.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,073 in March.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish gross average wage in the enterprise sector rose to 1,073 zlotys in March from 1,025 zlotys in February and was 21.4 percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	MARCH 97   FEB 97	 MARCH 1996</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN    1,073	1,025	    884</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
